OL,3,GNEWSAPet owners frustrated with winter
OL,4,Aferry schedule
OL,5,
OL,6,FPet owners in Guernsey say they are
OL,7,Ffrustrated by this year's winter ferry
OL,8,Fschedule, claiming it is adding
OL,9,Fhundreds of pounds in extra costs for
OL,10,Ftravel to the UK.
OL,12,FFrom 1 November, five of the seven
OL,13,Fweekly Brittany Ferries sailings from
OL,14,FGuernsey to the UK will travel via
OL,15,FCherbourg, France.
OL,17,FAs the route leaves the Common Travel
OL,18,FArea, pet owners are now required to
OL,19,Fhave a valid Animal Health Certificate
OL,20,F(AHC), even if they do not intend to
OL,21,Fdisembark in France.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
