OL,3,GNEWSAPet owners frustrated with winter
OL,4,Aferry schedule
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Brittany Ferries spokesperson said
OL,7,Fthe need for AHC is required by UK's
OL,8,FDepartment for Environment, Food and
OL,9,FRural Affairs (Defra) and added that
OL,10,Fpets can still travel without
OL,11,Fadditional paperwork on direct
OL,12,FGuernsey-Portsmouth sailings.
